# Reference list of every environment variable. Real values go ONLY in:
#   frontend/.env.local   (copy of frontend/.env.example)
#   backend/.env          (copy of backend/.env.example)
# Both are git-ignored. See docs/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md.
#
# Frontend (public, bundled into the browser):  VITE_API_BASE_URL, VITE_SUPABASE_URL, VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
# Backend (private):  APP_ENV, LOG_LEVEL, LOG_JSON, CORS_ORIGINS, DATABASE_URL,
#                     SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_JWT_ISSUER, SUPABASE_JWT_JWKS_URL, SUPABASE_JWT_AUDIENCE,
#                     JWKS_CACHE_TTL_SECONDS, JWKS_REFRESH_COOLDOWN_SECONDS, JWKS_MAX_STALE_SECONDS, JWT_LEEWAY_SECONDS
# Operator shell only (scripts/provision_account.py; never in a .env that the app loads, never in CI logs):
#                     SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, ADMIN_DATABASE_URL, PASSWORD_RESET_REDIRECT_URL
#
# NEVER place the Supabase service-role key or the database password in any VITE_* variable.
